    "canonical_ref": "Aristo.6.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The majority believe, as it is affirmed also in the Dispute between Jason and Papiscus, and as Tertullian in his book Against Praxeas contends,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
